#. module: portoko_web_responsive
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:portoko_web_responsive.field_res_users__ptk_chatter_position
msgid ""
"Automatic: Odoo default (side panel only on very wide screens).\n"
"Side: side panel from 1200px wide, useful on 1366px laptops.\n"
"Bottom: always below the form."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis: bawaan Odoo (panel samping hanya di layar sangat lebar).\n"
"Samping: panel samping mulai lebar 1200px, pas untuk laptop 1366px.\n"
"Bawah: selalu di bawah formulir."

