#. module: portoko_web_responsive
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:portoko_web_responsive.field_res_users__ptk_home_on_login
msgid ""
"Show the PORTOKO home screen (all apps) after signing in, instead of opening"
" the first app. Links that point to a specific record or menu still open "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan beranda PORTOKO (semua aplikasi) setelah login, bukan langsung "
"membuka aplikasi pertama. Tautan ke record atau menu tertentu tetap langsung"
" terbuka."

